WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.580
Every rupee the government

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.300
spends leaves a trail.

3
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.430
One office follows it.

4
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.200
Appointed by warrant.

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.020
The Comptroller and Auditor

6
00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.400
General is appointed by the

7
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.540
President, by warrant under hand

8
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:13.520
and seal.

9
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.900
Article one forty eight.

10
00:00:16.101 --> 00:00:16.861
Hard to remove.

11
00:00:16.861 --> 00:00:19.501
The CAG can be removed only the

12
00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:21.481
way a Supreme Court judge is

13
00:00:21.481 --> 00:00:23.601
removed. So the audited cannot

14
00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.091
scare the auditor.

15
00:00:26.027 --> 00:00:27.887
Pay that cannot be cut.

16
00:00:27.887 --> 00:00:30.047
After appointment, pay and

17
00:00:30.047 --> 00:00:31.787
pension cannot be cut.

18
00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:33.887
The office's costs are charged

19
00:00:33.887 --> 00:00:36.087
on the Consolidated Fund, not

20
00:00:36.087 --> 00:00:37.517
voted each year.

21
00:00:37.977 --> 00:00:40.417
Six years, then no next job.

22
00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:42.537
The term is six years, or till

23
00:00:42.537 --> 00:00:44.157
age sixty five.

24
00:00:44.157 --> 00:00:45.737
After that, no other government

25
00:00:45.737 --> 00:00:48.457
office. So, no favour is worth

26
00:00:48.457 --> 00:00:51.047
currying. Dry, but deliberate.

27
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.970
Auditor of the Union and the

28
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.450
States. It audits the accounts

29
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.050
of the Union, the States and

30
00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:59.030
other bodies, as Parliament's

31
00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:00.180
law says.

32
00:01:00.709 --> 00:01:02.689
The reports go to Parliament.

33
00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:04.249
Union reports go to the

34
00:01:04.249 --> 00:01:06.189
President, who lays them before

35
00:01:06.189 --> 00:01:07.509
both Houses.

36
00:01:07.509 --> 00:01:08.829
Then the Public Accounts

37
00:01:08.829 --> 00:01:10.419
Committee examines them.

38
00:01:11.598 --> 00:01:12.271
For GS2:

39
00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:14.578
Articles one forty eight to one

40
00:01:14.578 --> 00:01:15.198
fifty one.

41
00:01:15.198 --> 00:01:17.538
Removal like a Supreme Court

42
00:01:17.538 --> 00:01:20.218
judge. Six years or sixty five.

43
00:01:20.218 --> 00:01:22.558
Reports to the President, then

44
00:01:22.558 --> 00:01:23.358
Parliament.

45
00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:26.779
Public money, counted in public.
